1
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:26,348
[HOST] In late 1971, in the
affluent suburban town of Westfield,

2
00:00:26,348 --> 00:00:30,400
New Jersey, an unsettling silence
fell over the Breeze Knoll mansion.

3
00:00:31,200 --> 00:00:34,009
It was an imposing nineteen-room
