moral rectitude, and genuine piety.

30
00:02:05,940 --> 00:02:10,441
Yet, that very facade of absolute propriety
generated a formidable “Halo Effect”,

31
00:02:10,441 --> 00:02:14,220
blinding the surrounding community
to any dark suspicions for years.

32
00:02:15,170 --> 00:02:19,010
People simply refused to believe that
an impeccably polite gentleman who

33
00:02:19,010 --> 00:02:22,850
