34
00:02:23,650 --> 00:02:26,022
When early warning signs quietly surfaced,

35
00:02:26,022 --> 00:02:30,370
collective normalcy bias led society to
discount the most critical red flags.

36
00:02:31,320 --> 00:02:34,753
In prestigious, affluent communities
like the town of Westfield,

37
00:02:34,753 --> 00:02:37,864
people often lull themselves
into the illusion that social

38
00:02:37,864 --> 00:02:40,600
