inadvertently paralyzed

41
00:02:48,087 --> 00:02:50,280
society's natural instinct for vigilance.

42
00:02:51,230 --> 00:02:52,577
For nearly an entire month,

43
00:02:52,577 --> 00:02:54,772
while the mansion blazed
with lights through

44
00:02:54,772 --> 00:02:57,217
winter nights and mail
piled high upon the porch,

45
00:02:57,217 --> 00:03:00,310
