83
00:05:05,580 --> 00:05:09,371
Whenever I walked past Breeze
Knoll on freezing winter evenings,

84
00:05:09,371 --> 00:05:12,747
seeing those lonely lights
and hearing faint organ hymns,

85
00:05:12,747 --> 00:05:14,820
