97
00:05:47,332 --> 00:05:50,120
under the weight of an
overly strict household,

98
00:05:50,120 --> 00:05:52,789
telling myself that an
upstanding father like

99
00:05:52,789 --> 00:05:55,280
Mr List could never harm his own children.

100
00:05:56,430 --> 00:05:59,180
My own naive hesitation
