104
00:06:10,800 --> 00:06:13,089
On the evening of December 7, 1971,

105
00:06:13,089 --> 00:06:18,320
Westfield police officers pried open an
unlatched basement window to gain entry.

106
00:06:19,320 --> 00:06:22,585
A gust of freezing, tomb-like air
